WEBVTT

00:19:58.882 --> 00:20:00.470
it's so interesting.

00:20:00.732 --> 00:20:02.532
Three percent of the people buy them.

00:20:02.532 --> 00:20:03.563
(Laughter)

00:20:03.563 --> 00:20:06.434
When you have too many choices,
you have no choice.

00:20:06.953 --> 00:20:09.233
What do you do when you have
too many choices?

00:20:09.233 --> 00:20:10.993
Just cross off a bunch of choices.

00:20:10.993 --> 00:20:13.955
Psychologists tells us we can't handle
more than five to seven.

00:20:13.955 --> 00:20:15.483
I'd say it's five.

00:20:15.483 --> 00:20:18.374
If you've got a bunch of choices,
cross them all off,

00:20:18.374 --> 00:20:20.884
just pick the five and then
make your decision there.

00:20:20.884 --> 00:20:25.254
"Oh my God! What if I pick the wrong ones?
What if I cross off the wrong ones?"

00:20:25.254 --> 00:20:26.262
Right?

00:20:26.262 --> 00:20:29.432
Well, you won't, because it's
the pizza or Chinese food thing.

00:20:29.432 --> 00:20:32.802
You're at the office and everybody says,
"Let's go out to lunch today."